8. Return to B (already checked).  
9. Backtrack to A.  
10. Go to C (unvisited).  
   - Check C (if it matches the search criteria).  
   - Find neighbor E.  
11. Go to E (unvisited).  
   - Check E (if it matches the search criteria).  
   - Find neighbor F.  
12. Go to F (unvisited).  
    - Check F (if it matches the search criteria).  
