","The index of refraction (n) is defined as the ratio of the speed of light in a vacuum (v₀) to the speed of light in a medium (v):  
\[
n = \frac{v_0}{v}
\]  
Given that the speed of light in the plastic is 0.680 times the speed of light in a vacuum, we have \( v = 0.680 v_0 \).  
Substituting this into the formula for the index of refraction:  
\[
n = \frac{v_0}{0.680 v_0} = \frac{1}{0.680} \approx 1.535
\]  
Thus, the index of refraction for yellow light in the plastic is approximately \(\boxed{1.535}\).",relevance,"# Task Description
